  "description": "Example solutions that combine implementation patterns from the mission packages and Common Capabilities to support an agency with an Office of Inspector General, a FOIA program, grant programs, and a contracting office: one built on the agency’s shared platform, one with purpose-built systems for each office, and one in between.",
